<article class="board"><div class="board-media-column"><div class="board-media"><img src="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/SoulSchoolAcademy/MaxRESULTS/main/Naya%20Profile%203.jpg" alt="Naya Brain" loading="lazy"></div><div class="board-brand"><img src="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/SoulSchoolAcademy/MaxRESULTS/main/Maximus%202.png" alt="Human Maximus Codex"></div></div><div class="board-content"><span class="board-index">02 · INTELLIGENCE</span><h3>Naya Brain</h3><p class="board-lead">Give AI a richer foundation so it can reason from more than the latest sentence.</p><div class="answers">
